==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=to [[hit]] [[on]]}}

# {{transitive|idiomatic}} To [[flirt]] with; to [[approach]] and speak to (someone), seeking [[romance]], [[love]], [[sex]], etc.
#: ''That's the third guy that has '''hit on''' her tonight.''
# {{transitive|idiomatic}} To [[discover]], [[pinpoint]]; to think up; to [[realize]]; to [[invent]].
#: ''He '''hit on''' a great idea for improving the design.''

